# H3 population/attributes PMTiles source.
# Leave UNSET to use the bundled self-hosted dataset (public/wurman_cities.pmtiles),
# which carries the baked land cover / land use / POI attributes the Wurman grammar
# needs. Only set this to point at a HOSTED COPY of that same dataset (R2/CloudFront).
# Pointing it at the population-only kpop mirror degrades classification.
# VITE_POP_PMTILES_URL=https://your-cdn.example.com/wurman_cities.pmtiles
